  description: '3 Level 10 monsters

    You can also Xyz Summon this card by discarding
    1 "Rank-Up-Magic" Spell Card and using a "Utopia" monster you control as the
    Xyz Material. (Xyz Materials attached to that monster also become Xyz Materials
    on this card.) Once per turn: You can target 1 "Number" monster in your Graveyard;
    Special Summon it in Defense Position, but its effects are negated. During either
    player''s turn, when a monster effect is activated that targets this face-up
    card: You can detach 1 Xyz Material from this card; negate the activation, and
    if you do, destroy that card.'
